@@ -80,6 +80,16 @@
           values: ``film`` (transparency unit), ``adf``, ``infrared``,
           ``flatbed``, ``color``. Unknown values are ignored.
 
+        * ``any_capabilities`` (``as``)
+
+          Only offer scanners that have at least one of these capabilities,
+          with the same values. It is applied together with
+          ``required_capabilities``. An application for documents asks for
+          ``['flatbed', 'adf']``, one for film for ``film`` in
